// What item lore shows, top to bottom. Move a line to move what it shows.
// Anything left out, or switched off with `/-`, is not shown.
// The item's name always stays on top of the tooltip.
//
// rarity  The rarity and kind, like "Epic Sword".
// lore    The item's `lore` text.
// stat    One stat, like `stat "damage"`, if the item has it. Its look is in
//         stats_format.kdl.
// stats   Every stat not placed with `stat`, in stats_format.kdl's order.
//         Includes what reforges and gems add.
// sockets The item's sockets and the gems in them.
// skills  The item's skills, in the order the item lists them.
// empty   A blank line. Dropped when what it separates is missing from an
//         item, so an item without lore does not get two in a row.

rarity
empty
lore
empty
stats
empty
sockets
empty
skills
